15:["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Protection against regressions：防止回归"}],"，通过自动化验证代码修改后原有功能不受破坏。\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["$","em","em-0",{"children":"The amount of code that is executed during the test."}]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["$","em","em-0",{"children":"The complexity of that code."}]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["$","em","em-0",{"children":"The code’s domain significance."}]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Resistance to refactoring：抗重构性"}],"，重构业务代码时，测试代码无需过多变动便可通过用例，证明重构无误。\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","em","em-0",{"children":"Tests provide an early warning when you break existing functionality"}],"."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","em","em-0",{"children":"You become confident that your code changes won’t lead to regressions"}],"."]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Fast feedback：快速反馈"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Maintainability：可维护性"}],"。\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["$","em","em-0",{"children":"How hard it is to understand the test."}]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["$","em","em-0",{"children":"How hard it is to run the test."}]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}]
